{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_83a81f041f3a457285b69b562c956acc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ef4b9e97508cb52f912eb536c5c775ed395a997e7834e7bd2c1b2d7ee6ee9e5c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"narcooo/inkos@091048383f41 snapshot 856156b1ba1f1007","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7d4e9932483c3ccb03b019c867858e087f07756594b5b04fedb6b1c534489d74","slc_93bf5e2e246bb4d94792a83e728fe44c35c6ea4193cb2dcb004a009bbcd7f769"],"source_ids":["src_7b614c56382452c183d13519429e16df","src_db327009533f506f93b17a992b13850d"],"text":"Prose, state, hooks, and run snapshots are validated in a chapter workspace and atomically committed together, so failures do not leave state advanced without persisted text.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_83a81f041f3a457285b69b562c956acc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_83a81f041f3a457285b69b562c956acc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f1a54fe597ed80fa1bb23df6b9aa630849996aa2c6c471be10eb3f7a5ad7eeee","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"narcooo/inkos@091048383f41 snapshot 856156b1ba1f1007","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_73f45e871c0c20c5da4bf3f476b2bfb41d104f3831849596208daccac9a48427","slc_8d6dcf8f8a16b042c682f51590b9e15dd351e9803d90306a82c9f80a925346e2","slc_cfd492d034f23bd8e1445d400f42378c4d394dcf8bb868626a3cbc647db83337"],"source_ids":["src_7b614c56382452c183d13519429e16df","src_db327009533f506f93b17a992b13850d"],"text":"The runtime is built on a pi-agent harness: the agent produces structured actions, and the host executes deterministic tools, manages confirmations and state, and judges completion from real files and tool results rather than model claims.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_83a81f041f3a457285b69b562c956acc"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_83a81f041f3a457285b69b562c956acc","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f79877e7ef7a5219f645183de6fd144626e24e41686393b5db5a89f8d73c2d1d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"narcooo/inkos@091048383f41 snapshot 856156b1ba1f1007","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_86bf726879e8b6fb01f2793a2a3212ec79cc08efc6441eb9b6970ab9f8d5bebe","slc_b42ae993408ff3a04f782fddf0c7433acc2c4db7394c20596f90f6a6a01b3832"],"source_ids":["src_db327009533f506f93b17a992b13850d"],"text":"The agent runtime builds on the pi project (@mariozechner/pi-ai and @mariozechner/pi-agent-core by Mario Zechner), and the provider bank includes Gemini, Moonshot, MiniMax, OpenRouter, Ollama, and other OpenAI-compatible services.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_83a81f041f3a457285b69b562c956acc"}
